OpenAdapt quickstart: show a task once in OpenEMR, run it, then watch it stop before saving a duplicate chart.
Synthetic data only. Files go to openadapt-quickstart
   restoring the synthetic baseline
   ✓ OpenEMR 8.0.0.3 at http://127.0.0.1:9741: reused the running copy 5.7s

1  Show it once · a referral as it was demonstrated once in OpenEMR 8.0.0.3
   ✓ Title: "Ms."                             2.1s
   ✓ First name: "OpenAdapt"                  5.2s
