   ✓ Click Confirm Create New Patient         36.8s
   The program compiled from it: 29 steps, certified under clinical-write. 0.5s

2  Run it · the program on 5 new referrals, all at once
   1/5  Ines Carvalho                      ✓ checked in OpenEMR's record  30.1s
   2/5  Theo Lindqvist                     ✓ checked in OpenEMR's record  30.2s
   3/5  Grace Adeyemi                      ✓ checked in OpenEMR's record  30.3s
   4/5  Arlo Whitcombe                     ✓ checked in OpenEMR's record  30.4s
