   5 of 5 saved and checked · 0 AI calls · $0.00 · 0.5s

3  Break it · a referral that matches an existing chart
   OpenEMR already has a chart for Rosa Delgado. The next referral is a Rosa Delgado with another birth date.
   What the screen showed:        "a matching chart: Delgado, Rosa, born 1958-03-27"
   What OpenEMR's record showed:  0 new charts
   OpenAdapt:                     ■ Stopped before saving: possible duplicate  24.5s
   Why: OpenEMR's duplicate check found an existing chart. The program saves only when it finds none, so it stopped before saving.

The demonstration clicked Confirm Create New Patient here. Replaying those clicks would have saved a possible duplicate. OpenAdapt stopped.

